Hi, Franki!

I had my interview with Paiute today. We had a really great chat and he off=
ered me the welcome center position for October and November and probably D=
ecember. I just wanted to thank you for your support on that.

Also I withdrew my ranger assistant application a few days ago so there won=
't be any conflict for April and September. I decided to wait on this - may=
be next year.

Thanks,
Sam


